{
    "chapter_num": 17,
    "verses_count": 27,
    "paragraphs_list": [
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Jesus Transfigured on the Mount"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 1,
                    "num_str": "1",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now after six days Jesus took Peter, James, and John his brother, led them up on a high mountain by themselves; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 2,
                    "num_str": "2",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "and He was transfigured before them. His face shone like the sun, and His clothes became as white as the light. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 3,
                    "num_str": "3",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And behold, Moses and Elijah appeared to them, talking with Him. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 4,
                    "num_str": "4",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then Peter answered and said to Jesus, “Lord, it is good for us to be here; if You wish, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU I will make"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "let us make here three tabernacles: one for You, one for Moses, and one for Elijah.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 5,
                    "num_str": "5",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "While he was still speaking, behold, a bright cloud overshadowed them; and suddenly a voice came out of the cloud, saying, “This is My beloved Son, in whom I am well pleased. Hear Him!” "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 6,
                    "num_str": "6",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And when the disciples heard "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "it,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " they fell on their faces and were greatly afraid. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 7,
                    "num_str": "7",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But Jesus came and touched them and said, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "“Arise, and do not be afraid.”"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 8,
                    "num_str": "8",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "When they had lifted up their eyes, they saw no one but Jesus only."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 9,
                    "num_str": "9",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now as they came down from the mountain, Jesus commanded them, saying, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "“Tell the vision to no one until the Son of Man is risen from the dead.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 10,
                    "num_str": "10",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And His disciples asked Him, saying, “Why then do the scribes say that Elijah must come first?”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 11,
                    "num_str": "11",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Jesus answered and said to them, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "“Indeed, Elijah is coming"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU omits first"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "first and will"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "restore all things."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 12,
                    "num_str": "12",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "But I say to you that Elijah has come already, and they"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "did not know him but did to him whatever they wished. Likewise"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "the Son of Man is also about to suffer at their hands.”"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 13,
                    "num_str": "13",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then the disciples understood that He spoke to them of John the Baptist."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "A Boy Is Healed"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 14,
                    "num_str": "14",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And when they had come to the multitude, a man came to Him, kneeling down to Him and saying, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 15,
                    "num_str": "15",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "“Lord, have mercy on my son, for he is "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. moonstruck"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "an epileptic and suffers severely; for he often falls into the fire and often into the water. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 16,
                    "num_str": "16",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "So I brought him to Your disciples, but they could not cure him.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 17,
                    "num_str": "17",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then Jesus answered and said, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "“O"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "unbelieving"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "faithless and"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "perverse generation, how long shall I be with you? How long shall I bear with you? Bring him here to Me.”"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 18,
                    "num_str": "18",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And Jesus rebuked the demon, and it came out of him; and the child was cured from that very hour."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 19,
                    "num_str": "19",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then the disciples came to Jesus privately and said, “Why could we not cast it out?”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 20,
                    "num_str": "20",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "So Jesus said to them, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "“Because of your"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU little faith"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "unbelief; for assuredly, I say to you,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "if you have faith as a mustard seed, you will say to this mountain, ‘Move from here to there,’ and it will move; and nothing will be impossible for you."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 21,
                    "num_str": "21",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU omits v. 21."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "However, this kind does not go out except by prayer and fasting.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Jesus Again Predicts His Death and Resurrection"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 22,
                    "num_str": "22",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now while they were "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU gathering together"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "staying in Galilee, Jesus said to them, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "“The Son of Man is about to be betrayed into the hands of men,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 23,
                    "num_str": "23",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "and they will kill Him, and the third day He will be raised up.”"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " And they were exceedingly sorrowful."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Peter and His Master Pay Their Taxes"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 24,
                    "num_str": "24",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "When they had come to "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU Capharnaum, here and elsewhere"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Capernaum, those who received the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. double drachma"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "temple"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " tax came to Peter and said, “Does your Teacher not pay the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "temple"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " tax?”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 25,
                    "num_str": "25",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "He said, “Yes.”"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And when he had come into the house, Jesus anticipated him, saying, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "“What do you think, Simon? From whom do the kings of the earth take customs or taxes, from their sons or from"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "strangers?”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 26,
                    "num_str": "26",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Peter said to Him, “From strangers.”"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Jesus said to him, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "“Then the sons are free."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 27,
                    "num_str": "27",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "Nevertheless, lest we offend them, go to the sea, cast in a hook, and take the fish that comes up first. And when you have opened its mouth, you will find a"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Gr. stater, the exact temple tax for two"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "piece of money; take that and give it to them for Me and you.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}